&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWpoqex_CUZSyapkd88p0T6aG90x1m7-NoI2i3nXTMO8g&oe=6B1041F4"}, {"file_name": "Trailer 2.png", "id": "1339585267486548", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_1339585270819881_5752003200383625231_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v0iGxVPPN1kQ7kNvwF4xDFm&_nc_oc=AdqdoX8zDxnj2fKHjqLUCb9beKZo5txnoWia5iQ2MoWWOIHbL9Ua30qlsddFkGnKchI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWhqZ-w906fDo-CZVcFRpsKvqtgnwpGWa5XloS8WPk5pA&oe=6B10368D"}, {"file_name": "Trailer 4.png", "id": "25299459349722807", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_25299459369722805_1875565800982623569_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oFZFvBfFcm8Q7kNvwE74UX2&_nc_oc=AdoV9BZg-rIZ3JmHtETlqtT3YyxHDGja7ZZQZ01etmopeZwIVkDsvY0iDP1GvSq3ESM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVO-VfEqAIw65d2EQSZ_wYAOFHBzdIe6GIV5AE5f_nEEQ&oe=6B10430F"}, {"file_name": "Trailer 5.png", "id": "2038404890292862", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819859_2038404893626195_50283950361106217_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Sm66oWKFdGEQ7kNvwEIKFP0&_nc_oc=Adock0Lf6xLgQ9IL18joDOl6YPtmgpXec4G8d7mneHO4zk0zPcae9kc8XtzsPw2Vt8k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXS7WZLB65PFzQZlHacMz7NHqCF5Nf9Jb-XYUrm5C20JQ&oe=6B103AF7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer poster.png", "id": "1340193764070608", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_1340193767403941_2787865297931591383_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t1IRa5_0d18Q7kNvwFai_Tz&_nc_oc=AdqeJend8E6G-gfxBP5azKWrt_GxrC_TdfAM34pnBCFzppVxxU8Quh1WxtmkxJI93Uk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWE38qZIAJKE-18zFlkusSYsxUkLtohTyzTo6P-vN1pow&oe=6B1051D8"}, "display_name": "Plank n' Kitty", "keywords": [], "long_description": "## Plank n' Kitty\n\nGran\u2019s cat has wandered off and ended up at the end of a plank high above the city!\n\nStep through the doorway into a virtual cartoon world, walk the plank, rescue the kitty, and bring it safely back to gran.\n\n**Plank \u2019n Kitty is a mixed-reality experience, not a game.**  \nIt\u2019s designed to be fun, approachable, and best enjoyed with friends or family taking turns.  \nEveryone can join in by watching the action on TV or mobile.\n\n---\n\n## What makes it different\n\n- **Two-way mixed-reality portal**  \n  A door in your room opens into a virtual world \u2014 and from the plank, the door becomes a portal back into your real room.\n\n- **Exciting but not extreme**  \n  High enough to feel thrilling, without pushing into fear-only territory. Accessible fun for everybody.\n\n- **Configurable play space**  \n  Preview and adjust the size and position to fit your room before you start.\n\n- **Perfect for group play**  \n  Take turns, watch reactions, and enjoy it together.\n\n- **TV casting support**  \n  Cast to a TV so everyone can see what the player sees.\n\n---\n\n## Device Support\nSupports mixed reality on Quest 2, Quest 3, and Quest Pro.  \nPassthrough quality varies by device.\n\n---\n\n## Comfort Note\nThis experience involves real-world movement.  \nThis is a **room-scale mixed reality experience** and adapts to your available space.  \nMake sure your area is clear before playing.", "short_description": "Gran\u2019s cat has gone missing. Step through the portal, walk the plank high above the city, and bring the kitty home. A fun, approachable mixed-reality experience made for friends, families, and party play."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.rayamedia.com/home/plank-n-kitty-privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rayamedia", "s